              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="3f73-d64e-43fa-7d1b">Single use. At the start of your opponent’s Declare Charges &amp; Charge Reactions sub-phase, nominate a single enemy unit that is able to declare a charge against this model (or its unit).
That enemy unit must make a Leadership test. If this test is passed, the unit may act as normal. However, if this test is failed, it must declare a charge against this model (or its unit).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
